2026-11-07T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-2479) 'Does the Maple dress read clean in Unity once its cloth-fit (PolyFEM + IPC) pass is done, or do spikes, a stray blendshape and stale weights still show?
 # tags: rfd:hook
