2026-11-07T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-2479) 'The Maple fit left four items open: hem spikes on the dress, the ClothFit blendshape that the fit shipped back into the Unity scene instead of consuming, other outfit pieces that were not carried through the same fit, and scene body weights that still reflect the pre-fit body. The unity-garment-cloth-fit skill covers the fit and bind steps these items touch.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2479  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-2479) 'The dress renders in Unity with no hem spikes, no ClothFit blendshape left on the mesh, every other outfit piece carried through the same fit, and body weights matching the fitted body.
